Introductory Experiments
1. To interface an LED with Arduino and write a program to turn ON the built-in LED for 1 second after every 2 seconds:
void setup() {
  // Initialize digital pin LED_BUILTIN as an output
  pinMode(LED_BUILTIN, OUTPUT);
}

// The loop function runs over and over again forever
void loop() {
  digitalWrite(LED_BUILTIN, HIGH); // Turn the LED ON
  delay(1000);                     // Wait for 1 second (1 sec = 1000 ms)
  digitalWrite(LED_BUILTIN, LOW);  // Turn the LED OFF by making the voltage LOW
  delay(2000);                     // Wait for 2 seconds (2 sec = 2000 ms)
}

